ess that leverages hash-graph, a lightweight and privacy-preserving quantum-resistant protocol, along with a machine learning approach. Accordingly, it provides a system model, design goals, a three-phase methodology, performance and security assessment metrics, simulation items, environments, and requirements that will guide new and experienced researchers in advancing SG-CPS cybersecurity. Copyright Β© 2026. Published by Elsevier Ltd.},
